# Source Temple MAP; its Lua count condition is ported to a named hook.
NAME:    eino_wide_crystal_templ
TAGS:    no_rotate temple_altars_10 temple_altars_15
PLACE:   Temple
ORIENT:  encompass
SHUFFLE: a'- / A"c, += / += / =+
SUBST:   a = b, '- = ., c = b, + = ., = = b
CLEAR:   A"
: vault.run("configure")
MAP
            bbbbb
         aaab...baaa
         a''-.{.-''a
        bb-bb...bb-bb
        b...bb.bb...b
        b.B.......B.b
    bbbbb...b...b...bbbbb
    b...bb+bb.B.bb+bb...b
bbbbb.B.+...b...b...+.B.bbbbb
b...b...b.T.bb=bb.T.b...b...b
b.B....bb...........bb....B.b
b...b...bbbbb.B.bbbbb...b...b
bbbbb.T....bb...bb....T.bbbbb
    b...b...bb=bb...b...b
    bbbbb.B.......B.bbbbb
        b...b...b...b
        bbbbb.C.bbbbb
            b...b
            bbbbb
ENDMAP
